{"id":"3fd94ba56d864509","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-godel-lob-logic.md","title":"Gödel–Löb logic GL","display":"df-godel-lob-logic — Gödel–Löb logic GL","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-godel-lob-logic","aliases":["72-df-godel-lob-logic"],"display":"df-godel-lob-logic — Gödel–Löb logic GL","depends_on":["[[72-df-modal-formula]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VII, section 2, printed p. 477, PDF p. 489","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-godel-lob-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-godel-lob-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-lob-logic — Gödel–Löb logic GL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"94fb82dfe6146007\" href=\"?note=94fb82dfe6146007\" title=\"72-df-modal-formula\">72-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VII, section 2, printed p. 477, PDF p. 489"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"94fb82dfe6146007\" href=\"?note=94fb82dfe6146007\" title=\"72-df-modal-formula\">72-df-modal-formula</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_m,p_i,\\bot_m,\\to_m,\\Box_m\">\\(\\mathcal F_m,p_i,\\bot_m,\\to_m,\\Box_m\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 遍历从下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 的全部函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_b\">\\(\\tau_b\\)</span> 是按公式有限树深度、由下式递归引入的布尔求值函数；方框子式在此求值中作为独立命题原子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\coloneqq\\{p_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\Box_m A:A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal U\\coloneqq\\{p_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\Box_m A:A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_b(p_i)\\coloneqq b(p_i),\\qquad\n\\tau_b(\\bot_m)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\tau_b(\\Box_m A)\\coloneqq b(\\Box_m A),\\qquad\n\\tau_b(A\\to_m B)\\coloneqq\\max\\{1-\\tau_b(A),\\tau_b(B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_b(p_i)\\coloneqq b(p_i),\\qquad\n\\tau_b(\\bot_m)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\tau_b(\\Box_m A)\\coloneqq b(\\Box_m A),\\qquad\n\\tau_b(A\\to_m B)\\coloneqq\\max\\{1-\\tau_b(A),\\tau_b(B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PTaut}_m\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathcal F_m:\\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathcal U}\\;\\tau_b(A)=1\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PTaut}_m\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathcal F_m:\\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathcal U}\\;\\tau_b(A)=1\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf K_m\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_m(A\\to_m B)\\to_m(\\Box_m A\\to_m\\Box_m B):A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf L_m\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_m(\\Box_m A\\to_m A)\\to_m\\Box_m A:A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf K_m\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_m(A\\to_m B)\\to_m(\\Box_m A\\to_m\\Box_m B):A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf L_m\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_m(\\Box_m A\\to_m A)\\to_m\\Box_m A:A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_0\\coloneqq\\mathsf{PTaut}_m\\cup\\mathsf K_m\\cup\\mathsf L_m,\\qquad\nH_{n+1}\\coloneqq H_n\\cup\\{B\\in\\mathcal F_m:\\exists A\\in H_n\\;(A\\to_m B)\\in H_n\\}\\cup\\{\\Box_m A:A\\in H_n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_0\\coloneqq\\mathsf{PTaut}_m\\cup\\mathsf K_m\\cup\\mathsf L_m,\\qquad\nH_{n+1}\\coloneqq H_n\\cup\\{B\\in\\mathcal F_m:\\exists A\\in H_n\\;(A\\to_m B)\\in H_n\\}\\cup\\{\\Box_m A:A\\in H_n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{GL}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}H_n,\\qquad\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\in\\mathsf{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{GL}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}H_n,\\qquad\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\in\\mathsf{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源将这一系统记作 L，并明确列出别名 GL。有限阶段闭包精确实现命题重言式、K 公理、Löb 公理、分离规则和必然化规则。这里定义的是无额外假设的定理关系；没有把带假设推导中不受限制的必然化加入定义。重言式求值只按命题骨架进行，因而没有把模态有效性误当成命题重言式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"94fb82dfe6146007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"94fb82dfe6146007","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-formula]] 的 $\\mathcal F_m,p_i,\\bot_m,\\to_m,\\Box_m$；$A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$n\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F_m,p_i,\\bot_m,\\to_m,\\Box_m","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\coloneqq\\{p_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\Box_m A:A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau_b(p_i)\\coloneqq b(p_i),\\qquad\n\\tau_b(\\bot_m)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\tau_b(\\Box_m A)\\coloneqq b(\\Box_m A),\\qquad\n\\tau_b(A\\to_m B)\\coloneqq\\max\\{1-\\tau_b(A),\\tau_b(B)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PTaut}_m\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathcal F_m:\\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathcal U}\\;\\tau_b(A)=1\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf K_m\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_m(A\\to_m B)\\to_m(\\Box_m A\\to_m\\Box_m B):A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf L_m\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_m(\\Box_m A\\to_m A)\\to_m\\Box_m A:A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"H_0\\coloneqq\\mathsf{PTaut}_m\\cup\\mathsf K_m\\cup\\mathsf L_m,\\qquad\nH_{n+1}\\coloneqq H_n\\cup\\{B\\in\\mathcal F_m:\\exists A\\in H_n\\;(A\\to_m B)\\in H_n\\}\\cup\\{\\Box_m A:A\\in H_n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{GL}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}H_n,\\qquad\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\in\\mathsf{GL}.","display":true}],"bytes":2403,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-321","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-godel-lob-logic|df-godel-lob-logic — Gödel–Löb logic GL]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-319","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-godel-lob-logic — Gödel–Löb logic GL](72-df-godel-lob-logic.md)"},{"id":"2b98f8844a547104","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-godel-lob-logic]] 的公式集 $\\mathcal F_m$、定理集 $\\mathsf{GL}$ 及对象语言构造子；$A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$n\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"18276c3dc8146182","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal F_m,\\mathsf{GL},\\Box_m,\\to_m$ 取 [[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]；$A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$n\\in\\omega$。下式引入反射实例集、有限 MP 阶段及逻辑 $\\mathsf S_m$。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-343","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-godel-lob-logic|df-godel-lob-logic — Gödel–Löb logic GL]]"},{"id":"e8c6112440a637e4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$i\\in\\omega$；$\\operatorname{Guard}_i,\\operatorname{pv}_m$ 与单变量代入取 [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]；$\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}$ 取 [[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]。"},{"id":"f9f6dea82d265159","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$；模态语法、经典命题缩写与 $\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}$ 使用 [[72-df-godel-lob-logic]] 的接口。"},{"id":"588ba1ca83000a13","anc